msgid "When it comes to passwords, length is better than complexity."
msgstr "Когда дело доходит до паролей, длина важнее сложности."

#: themes/BTE/templates/core/accounts/register.html:112
#: themes/BTE/templates/core/accounts/reset_password.html:54
